description:
Design a 32-bit wide, 3-to-1 multiplexer. The module takes three 32-bit inputs (data0_i, data1_i, data2_i) and a 2-bit select input (select_i) to output one of the three input data lines to data_o. When select_i is 00, output data0_i; when 01, output data1_i; when 10, output data2_i; and for any other value, default to data0_i.
