description:
Design a button-driven counter that counts up on each positive edge of the BTN input. The counter is 4 bits wide, allowing it to count from 0 to 15, after which it wraps around back to 0. The output COUNT increments by one with each button press, effectively functioning as a simple event counter.
module top_module(
   input  wire        BTN,
   output reg  [3:0]  COUNT
);

code:
module top_module(
   input  wire        BTN,
   output reg  [3:0]  COUNT
);always @(posedge BTN) begin
      if (COUNT == 15)
         COUNT <= 0;
      else
         COUNT <= COUNT + 1;
   end

endmodule

