Design a circuit that counts the number of HIGH (1) bits in an 8-bit input. The module takes an 8-bit input and produces a 4-bit output that represents the total count of HIGH bits. It utilizes a combinatorial logic approach with a for-loop to iterate through each bit of the input, incrementing a counter whenever it encounters a HIGH bit, thereby providing the functionality of a one-dimensional bit counter.
